==Description==
'''Brawler Lobster Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] as a reward for reaching Level 14 on the premium track. It had a cost of {{BeachBalls|410}} or {{Robux|46}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|2,460}} or {{Robux|738}}. This item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|58}} with a total cost of {{Robux|930}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a total cost of {{Robux|830}}.

==Appearance==
'''Brawler Lobster Charm''' appearance is based on the {{Color|Surf|Lobster}} [[Brawler]] skin. It has the skin attacking something with its claws. When used, it plays the sound of the {{Color|Surf|Lobster}} [[Brawler]] skin using its ''Reposition'' ability.

The color changes based on the player's username color, but appears orange in inventory preview.

